{"seq":3,"slug":"smart-manufacturing","title":"智能制造装备技术","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing","introMarkdown":"# 智能制造装备技术 简介\n\n智能制造装备技术专业面向制造业智能化转型的核心岗位，培养能够从事工业机器人编程与调试、数控多轴加工、智能产线运维及自动化设备技术支持的高素质技术技能型人才。本专业紧密对接\"中国制造2025\"战略与工业4.0发展需求，将传统制造技术与信息技术深度融合。\n\n本专业为三年制高职大专课程，毕业生主要就业方向包括：工业机器人系统集成与调试工程师、数控工艺编程员、智能产线运维技术员、MES系统实施工程师、数字孪生应用工程师等岗位。\n\n全部课程内容分为四大核心模块：\n\n**第一章 工业机器人编程**系统讲授机器人运动学原理、主流品牌编程语言（ABB RAPID、KUKA KRL、FANUC TP）以及协作机器人在柔性制造中的最新应用，帮助学生掌握从离线编程到现场调试的全流程技能。\n\n**第二章 数控高级技术**聚焦五轴联动加工、CAM编程仿真及精密测量三大方向，覆盖复杂零件从工艺规划到质量检验的完整链路，培养学生解决高端制造难题的能力。\n\n**第三章 智能产线技术**围绕PLC高级应用与工业组网、机器视觉在线检测、MES制造执行系统展开，使学生具备智能产线从方案设计到系统联调的综合能力。\n\n**第四章 数字孪生与工业4.0**涵盖数字孪生建模与虚拟调试、工业互联网平台搭建、智能工厂系统集成三大主题，帮助学生理解并实践制造业数字化转型的前沿技术体系。\n\n建议学习路径：先修第一、二章打好装备操作基础，再学第三章理解产线级系统集成，最后通过第四章把握数字化全局视野。每个模块均包含企业真实案例与动手实操项目，确保理论与实践紧密结合。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"industrial-robot-programming","title":"工业机器人编程","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/industrial-robot-programming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"robot-kinematics-control","title":"机器人运动学与控制","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/industrial-robot-programming/robot-kinematics-control"},{"seq":2,"slug":"robot-programming-languages","title":"机器人编程语言","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/industrial-robot-programming/robot-programming-languages"},{"seq":3,"slug":"collaborative-robot-applications","title":"协作机器人应用","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/industrial-robot-programming/collaborative-robot-applications"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"advanced-cnc-technology","title":"数控高级技术","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/advanced-cnc-technology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-axis-machining","title":"多轴加工技术","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/advanced-cnc-technology/multi-axis-machining"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cam-programming","title":"CAM编程与仿真","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/advanced-cnc-technology/cam-programming"},{"seq":3,"slug":"precision-measurement","title":"精密测量与质量","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/advanced-cnc-technology/precision-measurement"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"intelligent-production-lines","title":"智能产线技术","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/intelligent-production-lines","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"plc-advanced-networking","title":"PLC高级与组网","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/intelligent-production-lines/plc-advanced-networking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"machine-vision-inspection","title":"机器视觉检测","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/intelligent-production-lines/machine-vision-inspection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mes-production-management","title":"MES与生产管理","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/intelligent-production-lines/mes-production-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"digital-twin-industry40","title":"数字孪生与工业4.0","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/digital-twin-industry40","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-twin-modeling","title":"数字孪生建模","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/digital-twin-industry40/digital-twin-modeling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"industrial-iot-platform","title":"工业互联网平台","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/digital-twin-industry40/industrial-iot-platform"},{"seq":3,"slug":"smart-factory-integration","title":"智能工厂集成","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/digital-twin-industry40/smart-factory-integration"}]}]}